 framework's thin path; P-885; main's M83): the round's last line says whether
 the next round is needed, by what it moved and left; a third job after
 record, holding only actions: write, no secret and no seat code, dispatches
 the next round on that line alone; the hourly cron stays as the fallback;
 tests fail with each rule removed

